"lastcall  3 repos · 6 files · 8 hunks  standalone  [Accept All]                           watching W"
"┌──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│alpha                     │f1  M  +1 −1                           [A accept file] [U restore file]│"
"│  main · 3 files          │@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@                         [a accept] [u restore] [m flag]│"
"┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ↑ / k          previous entry / scroll up              u              restore the hunk           │"
"│ ↓ / j          next entry / scroll down                U              restore the whole file     │"
"│ PgUp / b       page up                                 m              flag it with a note        │"
"│ PgDn / Space   page down                               M              clear the file's flags     │"
"│ ⏎ / l / →      open the diff                           i              edit in place              │"
"│ Esc / h / ←    back to the file list (close help)      I              $EDITOR at the hunk        │"
"│ Tab            toggle focus                            d              ack the agent flag         │"
"│ n / ]          next hunk                               g              jump to the agent in herdr │"
"│ p / [          previous hunk                           w              workspace scope on/off     │"
"│ e              expand a collapsed file                 r              rescan now                 │"
"│ f              full paths                              ?              this help                  │"
"│ o              show org/repo                           q / Ctrl-C     quit                       │"
"│ a              accept the hunk or the selected entry   y / ⏎          confirm                    │"
"│ A              accept the whole file                   n / Esc        cancel                     │"
"│ Ctrl-A         accept everything listed                                                          │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ ^J is a newline in the note (⇧⏎ needs a kitty-protocol terminal)                                 │"
"│ shift+drag selects text (mouse capture is on)                                                    │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ any key closes                                                                                   │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
"│                          │                                                                       │"
"│                          │                                                                       │"
"└──────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
"↑↓ select  ⏎ open  n/p hunk  a accept hunk  A accept file  ^A accept all  ? help  q quit            "
